stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending_payment
    pending_payment --> waiting_verification: buyer upload bukti transfer
    waiting_verification --> pending_payment: seller menolak, wajib isi alasan
    waiting_verification --> confirmed: seller menyetujui bukti
    confirmed --> completed: seller menandai layanan selesai
    completed --> [*]: buyer memberi rating dan ulasan
    pending_payment --> cancelled: buyer atau seller membatalkan
    waiting_verification --> cancelled: buyer atau seller membatalkan
    confirmed --> cancelled: seller membatalkan
